{"overview":"این سریال روایت کننده داستان پسری به نام یامان است که در یه خانواده با اصالت متولد شده و در کودکی ربوده شده و بعد از سالها برمیگرده خونه‌اش و تلاش میکنه خودش رو ثابت کنه و در این راه مجادله میکنه.","tagline":"","overview_en":"A young boy abducted from a wealthy family grows up on the streets, forming a tight bond with other street children as he survives hardship and violence. Years later, he is unexpectedly reunited with his biological family, forcing him to navigate two completely different worlds. Torn between his past identity and new family ties, he fights to reclaim his place while confronting betrayal, class conflict, and emotional wounds.","tagline_en":"","runtime":120,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":36,"y":2023,"poster":"/skDntcucT92NslUhJxuj68Uuqyr.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":15,"y":2024,"poster":"/tk7Po63nnDrSto4h5uZoRhi3FiA.jpg"}],"episodes":51,"crew":["Çağatay Tosun"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["TR"],"cast":[{"name":"Halit Özgür Sarı","role":"Yaman","photo":"/5bnAgK5n3Edy9GTc0TbYgJ8GMfZ.jpg"},{"name":"Yurdaer Okur","role":"Serhan Soysalan","photo":"/4s8EXgAqEvboSiE942bc4RpmjyT.jpg"},{"name":"Dolunay Soysert","role":"Neslihan Soysalan","photo":"/fp6jAtAAbDLpoBkQs2GAUUFyOIj.jpg"},{"name":"Bertan Asllani","role":"Alaz Soysalan","photo":"/ov5Fr8PS0gctEHXvkoj9Z5zsVWu.jpg"},{"name":"Bertan Aslani","role":"Alaz Soysalan","photo":"/dcX5Y3IB994vPkRWqPJJWBZIVIX.jpg"},{"name":"Rojbin Erden","role":"Asi","photo":"/nRTrcE1UHlPlaztsGvrawMHUN4Q.jpg"},{"name":"Sezer Arıçay","role":"Cesur","photo":"/5CZkH2gNUTMDPn8xOV9uzSF9Kl4.jpg"},{"name":"Seray Özkan","role":"Çagla Soysalan","photo":"/39BxxLltqINo2hxq8NRIeWNSuxx.jpg"},{"name":"Tayanç Ayaydın","role":"Güven Aydin","photo":"/inYsIQR47uBIjQzH8d2OKRpaPcl.jpg"},{"name":"İlayda Akdoğan","role":"Derin Emirdag","photo":"/qhIKaKW4O9LhRqNL3KX3cvDmCWa.jpg"},{"name":"Nergis Öztürk","role":"Hande Emirdag","photo":"/igEAbtfmzAeBtUaMUAFMgILcxOf.jpg"},{"name":"کانبولات گورکم ارسلان","role":"Is